      "fieldId": "5a000009-0000-4000-a000-000000000009",
      "value": "`ext:slices` extension; optional `slice` block in `manifest.json` (`Slice`, `SliceSpec`, `SliceExternalRef` $defs); container-membership closure rules R1–R14; validation relaxations for slice archives.\n\n<!-- srs-integration:v1\next:slices\nschema:manifest.json\n-->",
